WEBVTT

01:35.880 --> 01:40.720
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.660 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 10]

01:44.120 --> 01:51.410
[Archery]

01:46.229 --> 01:47.800
Come one, come all!

01:47.920 --> 01:49.840
Don't miss your chance!

01:50.039 --> 01:51.280
Hit three arrows,

01:51.360 --> 01:53.200
and this love lock is yours.

01:53.229 --> 01:55.490
It symbolizes a long and happy marriage.

01:56.310 --> 01:57.920
Would you like to give it a try?

01:57.920 --> 01:58.920
Young Master Xia,

01:59.039 --> 02:00.510
that looks interesting.

02:03.710 --> 02:04.610
Let go!

02:08.280 --> 02:09.520
Shall we try?

02:10.520 --> 02:11.150
Sure.

02:13.030 --> 02:13.720
We'd like to try it.

02:13.720 --> 02:14.920
Okay, please.

02:16.300 --> 02:17.270
This way.

02:19.430 --> 02:19.800
Here.

02:19.870 --> 02:20.520
Thank you.

02:32.250 --> 02:33.550
Will you teach me?

02:34.960 --> 02:36.590
Archery isn't mastered in a day.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.290
But I'd like to try.

02:41.960 --> 02:42.630
All right.

02:44.370 --> 02:46.890
[Archery]

02:50.150 --> 02:51.350
Raise your left hand.

02:52.630 --> 02:53.490
Hold it firmly.

02:55.550 --> 02:57.079
Lower your right shoulder.

02:58.240 --> 02:58.900
Too low.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.100
Raise it a bit more.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.390
Relax.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.480
Is this how you

03:07.600 --> 03:09.120
taught her back then?

03:14.410 --> 03:15.490
Young Master Xia,

03:15.800 --> 03:17.000
if you just tell me these basics,

03:17.000 --> 03:18.590
I'll have a hard time learning.

03:18.590 --> 03:19.579
How about this?

03:20.000 --> 03:21.850
However you taught her back then,

03:21.850 --> 03:23.450
teach me the same way now.

03:34.400 --> 03:34.870
Come on.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.360
They look perfect together.

03:50.360 --> 03:51.040
Yes.

03:51.240 --> 03:53.150
The Prince of Zhennan and Princess Xiyang

03:53.150 --> 03:54.840
are both so good-looking.

03:54.870 --> 03:56.980
They're a match made in heaven.

04:01.120 --> 04:02.800
Am I a quick learner?

04:03.560 --> 04:05.300
You do have some talent.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.080
When we're married,

04:07.120 --> 04:08.650
will you teach me every day?

04:10.310 --> 04:10.960
Okay.

04:14.080 --> 04:16.430
Miss Yixiao, I've heard
your archery is unmatched.

04:16.430 --> 04:18.240
Since we have the opportunity today,

04:18.240 --> 04:19.899
could you show us your skills?

04:22.750 --> 04:24.430
Yixiao has an old injury on her hand.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.560
She can't draw a bow.

04:26.070 --> 04:27.270
Who says she can't?

04:34.630 --> 04:37.460
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

04:38.080 --> 04:41.340
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

04:41.930 --> 04:43.370
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

04:43.909 --> 04:47.310
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

04:44.840 --> 04:46.920
Today, I'll be your left hand.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.270
Let everyone see

04:48.870 --> 04:51.430
the grace of Jinxiu's top archer.

04:49.380 --> 04:52.330
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

04:52.870 --> 04:55.980
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

04:56.620 --> 04:59.230
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

05:00.030 --> 05:02.280
♪ My eyes ♪

05:02.780 --> 05:04.240
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

05:04.810 --> 05:06.350
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

05:07.520 --> 05:09.700
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

05:08.430 --> 05:09.630
Bravo! Bravo!

05:10.040 --> 05:11.160
Amazing.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.620
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

05:12.020 --> 05:13.280
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

05:15.390 --> 05:16.070
Miss.

05:16.190 --> 05:17.290
Nice shot.

05:17.510 --> 05:19.400
This love lock is yours.

05:24.160 --> 05:25.280
I'm giving this love lock

05:25.280 --> 05:26.320
to you two.

05:26.920 --> 05:28.560
I wish you a long,

05:28.580 --> 05:29.620
happy marriage.

05:33.680 --> 05:37.560
Though this lock is of simple material,

05:37.740 --> 05:39.270
it has a wonderful meaning.

05:39.310 --> 05:40.710
Miss Yixiao, I'll accept

05:40.740 --> 05:41.890
your gift.

05:45.030 --> 05:46.030
Young Master Xia,

05:46.580 --> 05:47.840
let me put it on for you.

05:50.030 --> 05:50.700
No need.

06:00.810 --> 06:03.160
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

06:01.850 --> 06:02.990
Don't make me do it!

06:03.720 --> 06:06.480
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

06:05.880 --> 06:06.860
Logically speaking,

06:06.860 --> 06:07.390
from so close,

06:07.200 --> 06:10.120
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

06:07.390 --> 06:08.880
and with you unguarded,

06:09.160 --> 06:10.310
it should have been someone familiar

06:10.310 --> 06:11.040
who shot you off the cliff.

06:10.750 --> 06:12.620
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

06:11.680 --> 06:13.120
I wasn't the one

06:13.160 --> 06:13.870
who shot you off that cliff.

06:13.550 --> 06:15.840
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

06:13.930 --> 06:15.120
Nor did I send anyone

06:15.120 --> 06:16.040
to kill you.

06:16.060 --> 06:17.360
Though we belong to rival nations,

06:16.470 --> 06:19.540
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

06:17.360 --> 06:18.120
and our hatred runs deep,

06:18.120 --> 06:18.830
there's someone else

06:18.830 --> 06:20.480
who wants you dead even more than I do.

06:20.480 --> 06:25.560
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

06:20.750 --> 06:21.770
To me,

06:21.920 --> 06:23.750
you're not just a female general
under my banner

06:23.750 --> 06:24.820
but also the person I'm closest to

06:24.820 --> 06:25.830
and the one I trust most.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.990
Have you forgotten

06:26.500 --> 06:28.060
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

06:27.040 --> 06:27.870
that on the cliff,

06:27.870 --> 06:29.190
the arrow that hit you

06:28.710 --> 06:32.270
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

06:30.000 --> 06:32.870
must have come from someone
you trusted completely?

06:32.870 --> 06:34.480
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

06:35.310 --> 06:38.240
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

06:39.090 --> 06:40.790
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

06:41.630 --> 06:44.640
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

06:45.460 --> 06:48.540
♪ Looking for me ♪

06:46.930 --> 06:47.800
What's wrong?

06:53.730 --> 06:55.260
Is your head hurting again?

06:55.360 --> 06:56.070
I'm fine.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.360
Yixiao,

06:58.430 --> 06:59.070
if you're not feeling well,

06:59.070 --> 07:00.130
I'll take you back.

07:13.150 --> 07:14.680
Thank you for your concern.

07:15.000 --> 07:15.830
I'm fine.

07:20.420 --> 07:20.920
Lu Ke.

07:21.000 --> 07:21.390
Yes.

07:21.690 --> 07:23.820
Go get Young Mistress Ling to my manor.

07:26.160 --> 07:27.020
Your Highness,

07:27.270 --> 07:28.870
there's a street performance over there.

07:28.870 --> 07:30.150
Let's go take a look.

07:40.250 --> 07:42.050
Besides, with your memory lost,

07:42.070 --> 07:43.640
you have no clues at all now.

07:43.830 --> 07:45.060
Even if the person who wants you dead

07:45.060 --> 07:47.420
is standing right in front of you now,

07:47.440 --> 07:49.170
you wouldn't be able to tell it.

07:49.680 --> 07:50.360
As for me,

07:50.670 --> 07:51.730
I have the manpower

07:52.040 --> 07:53.100
and the abilities.

07:53.390 --> 07:54.720
You can make use of me.

07:55.950 --> 07:56.580
Your Highness,

07:56.580 --> 07:59.110
I'll go fetch
Young Mistress Ling right away.

07:59.950 --> 08:00.680
Lu Ke.

08:01.040 --> 08:01.800
No need.

08:07.450 --> 08:09.060
I'll go to find Xueying myself.

08:09.060 --> 08:09.940
Don't bother.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.630
Don't worry about me.

08:11.800 --> 08:13.060
You're overthinking.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.510
I won't waste

08:14.510 --> 08:16.280
the slightest thought on you.

08:16.400 --> 08:17.530
That's for the best.

08:23.750 --> 08:24.610
Your Highness,

08:25.000 --> 08:26.530
may I borrow your carriage?

08:30.600 --> 08:31.390
Princess Xiyang,

08:31.390 --> 08:32.240
I have matters to attend to,

08:32.240 --> 08:33.440
so I'll take my leave.

08:42.990 --> 08:48.650
[Zhengnian Hall]

09:09.430 --> 09:10.240
What's wrong?

09:10.260 --> 09:11.590
Are you feeling unwell?

09:11.750 --> 09:12.440
I'm fine.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.170
Since losing my memory,

09:15.190 --> 09:17.080
I've been getting frequent headaches.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.270
They will pass soon.

09:28.030 --> 09:29.240
I was going to rub

09:29.260 --> 09:31.190
the Baihui acupoint on your crown.

09:33.310 --> 09:34.760
You know medicine?

09:35.600 --> 09:36.730
You don't remember?

09:37.790 --> 09:38.840
After rescuing you

09:38.840 --> 09:39.970
from the death camp,

09:40.150 --> 09:41.270
you were jumpy all the time

09:41.270 --> 09:42.870
with unbearable headaches.

09:42.870 --> 09:43.840
The army physician said

09:43.840 --> 09:45.000
massaging the Baihui acupoint

09:45.000 --> 09:46.080
on your head could help.

09:46.080 --> 09:47.000
But you wouldn't allow

09:47.000 --> 09:48.310
anyone to come near you,

09:48.310 --> 09:49.910
not even the army physician,

09:50.080 --> 09:50.880
except for me.

09:52.670 --> 09:54.000
It seems that back then,

09:54.250 --> 09:55.520
I trusted you a lot.

09:58.670 --> 09:59.550
You just said

09:59.550 --> 10:00.720
you rescued me

10:00.720 --> 10:01.850
from the death camp.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.660
What is the death camp?

10:04.870 --> 10:06.120
Your experience there

10:06.120 --> 10:07.870
left a mark on you for life.

10:09.090 --> 10:10.690
You don't remember any of it?

10:14.720 --> 10:15.510
No.

10:18.840 --> 10:19.760
In Jinxiu City,

10:19.960 --> 10:21.620
there was once a lesser noble.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.270
He wanted to groom a force

10:23.270 --> 10:24.750
that would be loyal only to him,

10:24.750 --> 10:26.200
so he secretly abducted orphans

10:26.200 --> 10:27.460
and sent them to the death camp,

10:27.460 --> 10:29.080
forcing each of them to learn how to kill.

10:29.080 --> 10:30.480
You have no parents,

10:30.570 --> 10:31.960
no family, and no ties.

10:32.030 --> 10:32.670
Your life

10:32.690 --> 10:34.220
is worth less than an ant's.

10:34.560 --> 10:35.900
From time to time,

10:35.920 --> 10:37.980
they'd send in condemned prisoners.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.010
Only the victors

10:39.390 --> 10:40.630
got to survive.

10:56.870 --> 10:57.550
I guess

10:58.600 --> 10:59.480
it must be because you rescued me

10:59.480 --> 11:00.840
from the death camp

11:01.750 --> 11:03.080
that I only trusted you

11:03.270 --> 11:04.720
back then.

11:06.550 --> 11:07.350
That's right.

11:07.630 --> 11:09.200
Then you served in my army

11:10.000 --> 11:11.480
and made the military camp your home.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.790
You considered Ning Fei and Weiran

11:12.790 --> 11:13.720
as your family.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.760
So that's how it was.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.240
All those years, you and I

11:20.240 --> 11:22.390
fought on the battlefield
and risked our lives.

11:22.390 --> 11:24.590
I don't know how many times you saved me.

11:24.600 --> 11:25.800
Do you still remember

11:25.910 --> 11:27.000
when you insisted on

11:27.000 --> 11:28.870
wearing a red battle robe
on the battlefield?

11:28.870 --> 11:30.080
That's why you were called

11:30.080 --> 11:31.480
the Red-Clad General.

11:33.790 --> 11:35.870
I guess it was because on the battlefield,

11:35.870 --> 11:38.000
one was bound to get wounded and bleed,

11:38.000 --> 11:39.600
and wearing a red robe meant

11:39.630 --> 11:40.720
even if I bled,

11:40.910 --> 11:42.440
the enemy wouldn't notice,

11:42.720 --> 11:43.790
it wouldn't hurt morale,

11:43.790 --> 11:45.190
and I wouldn't look weak.

11:46.360 --> 11:46.870
No.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.550
You did it for me.

11:50.630 --> 11:52.210
You insisted on wearing red

11:52.480 --> 11:54.280
to stand out on the battlefield.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.500
You wanted

11:55.630 --> 11:57.020
to draw the enemy's attention

11:57.020 --> 11:58.420
and take the blows for me.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.560
Unfortunately,

12:04.600 --> 12:06.130
I don't remember anything.

12:08.080 --> 12:08.880
It's alright.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.130
There's no rush.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.850
We have plenty of time.

12:12.150 --> 12:13.390
I'll help you remember everything—

12:13.390 --> 12:14.120
everything

12:14.120 --> 12:15.580
we went through together.

12:15.910 --> 12:16.960
Trust me,

12:17.200 --> 12:17.790
will you?

12:26.440 --> 12:27.030
Okay.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.080
Xia Jingshi,

12:32.650 --> 12:34.450
so it was you who tried to kill me.

12:35.120 --> 12:37.120
But why do you want me dead?

12:40.320 --> 12:40.840
Your Highness.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.150
Fu Yixiao

12:42.200 --> 12:43.200
is so ungrateful.

12:43.740 --> 12:44.320
Your Highness,

12:44.320 --> 12:45.510
don't stoop to her level.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.360
There's no need to get upset

12:46.360 --> 12:48.200
with a woman
who can't tell right from wrong.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.960
She doesn't remember anything,

12:49.960 --> 12:51.240
but the moment she saw her old master,

12:51.240 --> 12:51.980
she was desperate

12:51.980 --> 12:53.240
to return to him

12:53.240 --> 12:54.770
and serve in his army again.

12:55.030 --> 12:56.600
She seemed smart enough before,

12:56.600 --> 12:57.570
but at the critical moment,

12:57.570 --> 12:58.750
she's clueless,

12:58.750 --> 12:59.390
not even knowing

12:59.390 --> 13:00.240
the one who wants her dead

13:00.240 --> 13:01.150
is Xia Jingshi.

13:02.840 --> 13:03.240
No.

13:05.440 --> 13:06.790
She already knows.

13:10.040 --> 13:10.800
Lu Ke.

13:10.970 --> 13:11.780
No need.

13:15.750 --> 13:16.640
Help me.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.850
I'll go to find Xueying myself.

13:24.150 --> 13:24.860
Wait…

13:24.890 --> 13:26.270
What about that letter?

13:27.390 --> 13:28.140
Well,

13:28.200 --> 13:29.840
it's been successfully
delivered to Jinxiu.

13:29.840 --> 13:30.360
By now,

13:30.360 --> 13:32.560
the Emperor of Jinxiu must have read it.

13:40.160 --> 13:41.660
[Yifeng Hall]

13:42.120 --> 13:43.390
So,

13:43.510 --> 13:44.630
the Prince of Zhennan and Xiyang

13:44.630 --> 13:46.310
shot arrows together.

13:46.360 --> 13:48.570
They truly seem like a loving couple.

13:48.840 --> 13:49.440
Did a lot of people

13:49.440 --> 13:50.840
see that?

13:51.320 --> 13:52.720
Quite a few people saw it.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.050
I personally heard

13:54.080 --> 13:55.390
many of the commoners present

13:55.390 --> 13:56.480
praising the two of them,

13:56.480 --> 13:58.480
saying they look perfect together.

13:59.080 --> 14:00.350
The people of Susha

14:00.440 --> 14:01.720
have prejudices
against the Prince of Zhennan

14:01.720 --> 14:03.580
that won't disappear overnight.

14:03.750 --> 14:05.550
Luckily,
because of this marriage alliance,

14:05.550 --> 14:07.080
His Majesty granted a general amnesty,

14:07.080 --> 14:09.580
which eased

14:09.720 --> 14:11.720
some of the resentment against him.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.100
It's just a pity

14:13.360 --> 14:14.170
that Fu Yixiao

14:14.200 --> 14:16.250
got into the Prince of Zhennan's carriage
in the end

14:16.250 --> 14:17.790
and headed back with him.

14:18.030 --> 14:19.740
The Prince of Zhennan actually left

14:19.740 --> 14:20.910
Princess Xiyang alone.

14:20.910 --> 14:22.050
I'm afraid those with ill intentions

14:22.050 --> 14:23.360
who noticed this

14:23.630 --> 14:25.720
will spread rumors.

14:26.930 --> 14:28.430
I'd like to see

14:29.030 --> 14:31.140
which fool out there

14:31.200 --> 14:33.480
dares to spread rumors and start trouble.

14:33.480 --> 14:35.050
All right, go back.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.790
Don't come here for the next few days

14:36.790 --> 14:37.920
unless I summon you,

14:38.000 --> 14:39.390
lest the Princess become suspicious.

14:39.390 --> 14:39.920
Yes,

14:40.030 --> 14:41.090
I'll take my leave.

14:46.630 --> 14:48.870
I heard a rumor from the court today

14:49.080 --> 14:50.790
about Fu Yixiao.

14:53.540 --> 14:54.440
Your Majesty,

14:54.550 --> 14:55.820
that's true.

14:56.030 --> 14:57.930
The Prince of Zhennan,
under the pretext of exchanging prisoners,

14:57.930 --> 14:59.080
has requested to take Fu Yixiao

14:59.080 --> 14:59.960
back to Jinxiu.

15:01.550 --> 15:03.240
Summon Xun Xiang to see me.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.480
Yes.

15:14.510 --> 15:15.370
Your Highness.

15:18.200 --> 15:18.720
Yixiao.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.080
I heard you're ill,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.410
so I came to check on you.

15:23.360 --> 15:24.000
Weiran is still

15:24.000 --> 15:24.960
handling some official matters

15:24.960 --> 15:26.220
and will be here later.

15:29.640 --> 15:30.520
Miss Ling,

15:30.960 --> 15:31.600
how is she?

15:36.150 --> 15:36.870
Not good.

15:41.090 --> 15:42.420
Is there anything wrong

15:42.460 --> 15:43.660
with Yixiao's pulse?

15:43.810 --> 15:45.240
Yixiao is fine.

15:45.440 --> 15:47.750
I'll just give her something
to calm her nerves.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.720
I mean,

15:49.730 --> 15:50.790
Prince of Zhennan,

15:51.270 --> 15:52.670
you're not looking good.

15:54.790 --> 15:55.590
His Highness?

15:57.030 --> 15:58.480
Stop pretending to be fine.

15:58.480 --> 15:59.440
If you keep holding the blood in,

15:59.440 --> 16:00.390
when the toxins hit your heart,

16:00.390 --> 16:02.510
even the gods won't be able to save you.

16:02.510 --> 16:03.440
What do you mean?

16:04.440 --> 16:05.300
Your Highness!

16:05.850 --> 16:06.750
Your Highness.

16:14.500 --> 16:15.360
Your Highness!

16:15.910 --> 16:17.710
Your poison is flaring up again.

16:18.000 --> 16:18.860
Your Highness,

16:18.860 --> 16:19.820
hang in there.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.200
Reinforcements will arrive soon.

16:21.200 --> 16:21.890
Hang in there.

16:21.890 --> 16:22.650
Yixiao,

16:23.030 --> 16:24.120
go on without me.

16:25.040 --> 16:25.690
No.

16:25.880 --> 16:26.550
I'm not leaving.

16:26.550 --> 16:27.390
Listen to me,

16:27.720 --> 16:28.700
after I die,

16:28.870 --> 16:29.720
the Emperor certainly won't

16:29.720 --> 16:30.730
spare any of you.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.260
Take this.

16:33.480 --> 16:35.150
With it, you can command
the Zhennan Army.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.010
Get out of here.

16:36.020 --> 16:36.680
Now.

16:37.200 --> 16:38.200
I don't want this!

16:38.320 --> 16:39.510
I'm not leaving you behind.

16:39.510 --> 16:40.510
Don't worry about me.

16:40.510 --> 16:41.260
Just go.

16:41.550 --> 16:42.470
Go!

16:42.630 --> 16:44.840
I'll live or die with you, Your Highness!

16:44.840 --> 16:46.120
It's a military order!

16:51.030 --> 16:51.840
Stay alive.

17:09.359 --> 17:10.760
His poison has flared up.

17:11.950 --> 17:13.020
What kind of poison

17:13.200 --> 17:14.400
is he suffering from?

17:14.400 --> 17:16.349
There's no cure for that poison.

17:16.440 --> 17:18.109
Each month when the poison strikes,
he suffers greatly.

17:18.109 --> 17:20.310
He must take the antidote immediately.

17:21.420 --> 17:22.420
And the antidote?

17:25.030 --> 17:25.790
Where is it?

17:26.270 --> 17:27.030
The wedding procession

17:27.030 --> 17:28.400
will soon arrive in Yujing.

17:28.400 --> 17:30.600
The antidote will be delivered with it.

17:31.000 --> 17:31.730
Don't worry.

17:32.270 --> 17:33.000
I'm fine.

17:34.240 --> 17:34.960
Xueying,

17:36.070 --> 17:37.470
can you make an antidote?

17:38.160 --> 17:39.270
I can only prepare medicine

17:39.270 --> 17:40.200
to ease his pain

17:40.640 --> 17:42.040
and make him feel better.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.230
Thank you, Miss Ling.

17:52.440 --> 17:53.690
Don't just stand there.

17:53.690 --> 17:54.420
Come with me.

17:54.790 --> 17:55.350
Give me a hand.

17:55.350 --> 17:55.880
Okay.

18:07.070 --> 18:07.920
Do you really have a way

18:07.920 --> 18:09.520
to ease His Highness's pain?

18:09.960 --> 18:10.770
Of course.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.330
I tasted hundreds of herbs
when I was 5,

18:12.330 --> 18:13.480
learned diagnostics at 10,

18:13.480 --> 18:14.400
and by 13, I had mastered

18:14.400 --> 18:15.880
all of my father's medical skills.

18:15.880 --> 18:17.410
My treatments always work.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.830
How dare you doubt me?

18:19.030 --> 18:19.560
I just do.

18:20.200 --> 18:20.680
I...

18:20.680 --> 18:22.080
Are you really that good?

18:22.960 --> 18:23.590
Of course.

18:24.000 --> 18:26.330
I run the entire Zhengnian Villa
on my own.

18:26.440 --> 18:28.440
I can't do that with just empty talk.

18:29.550 --> 18:30.280
That's true.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.030
If the First Prince of Susha trusts you

18:32.030 --> 18:33.240
to treat Yixiao,

18:33.640 --> 18:35.160
you must have some skill.

19:00.360 --> 19:01.160
Yixiao.

19:04.790 --> 19:05.550
Don't worry.

19:06.110 --> 19:07.200
I'll be fine.

19:12.490 --> 19:13.480
If you have any questions,

19:13.480 --> 19:14.410
go ahead and ask.

19:15.720 --> 19:17.120
How did you get poisoned?

19:17.310 --> 19:18.170
It's so severe.

19:20.360 --> 19:21.390
You're still the same,

19:21.390 --> 19:22.500
just like before.

19:23.140 --> 19:24.000
When you have doubts,

19:24.000 --> 19:26.130
you'll stop at nothing to get answers.

19:26.270 --> 19:28.330
You can't keep anything to yourself.

19:28.830 --> 19:30.960
The poison in me is a secret.

19:31.930 --> 19:32.880
I remember

19:33.500 --> 19:34.440
the first time you saw me

19:34.440 --> 19:35.560
suffering from the poison.

19:35.560 --> 19:37.110
You kept asking me why.

19:37.550 --> 19:38.680
I wouldn't tell you,

19:39.400 --> 19:41.000
but you just wouldn't give up

19:41.030 --> 19:41.960
and kept asking.

19:42.270 --> 19:42.880
So,

19:43.780 --> 19:45.840
you're still not planning to tell me?

19:51.160 --> 19:51.960
Not now.

19:52.750 --> 19:54.270
One day I will tell you.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.410
Is that

19:56.440 --> 19:58.100
what you told me back then too?

19:58.750 --> 19:59.440
Yes.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.880
The truth behind my poisoning—

20:01.880 --> 20:02.310
you,

20:02.720 --> 20:03.790
Ning Fei, and Weiran—

20:03.790 --> 20:05.190
none of you know about it.

20:10.830 --> 20:12.630
Have you remembered something?

20:21.470 --> 20:22.830
Bits and pieces.

20:23.150 --> 20:25.030
I remember one time your poison flared up.

20:25.030 --> 20:26.540
You thought you were going to die

20:26.540 --> 20:27.880
and told me to leave you behind

20:27.880 --> 20:29.140
and escape for my life.

20:32.100 --> 20:33.160
That was the battle

20:33.160 --> 20:34.620
at Shahekou two years ago.

20:34.640 --> 20:36.550
We were in a hopeless situation.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.720
I ordered you to leave me behind.

20:39.200 --> 20:40.310
That was the first time

20:40.310 --> 20:41.640
you disobeyed my order,

20:42.200 --> 20:44.000
staying by my side no matter what

20:45.030 --> 20:47.030
until the reinforcements arrived.

20:47.990 --> 20:49.170
I never thought

20:49.800 --> 20:50.920
we'd been through so many brushes

20:50.920 --> 20:52.120
with death together.

20:58.830 --> 20:59.400
Yixiao.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.130
Don't worry.

21:04.060 --> 21:05.160
I'll help you remember

21:05.160 --> 21:06.760
everything you want to know.

21:07.350 --> 21:09.150
Ask me anything you want to know.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.070
I'll tell you.

21:11.310 --> 21:12.960
From now on, with me by your side,

21:12.960 --> 21:14.730
you won't get hurt again.

21:15.070 --> 21:15.920
Trust me,

21:16.550 --> 21:17.270
will you?

21:27.960 --> 21:29.160
Of course I trust you.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.170
There's a scar on my left leg.

21:32.400 --> 21:34.260
I didn't even remember how I got it

21:34.300 --> 21:35.480
until Ning Fei

21:35.480 --> 21:36.270
told me.

21:37.200 --> 21:38.040
It turns out

21:38.550 --> 21:40.420
I was once ambushed and captured.

21:40.750 --> 21:42.790
If you hadn't risked your life to save me,

21:42.790 --> 21:44.680
my leg would have been crippled.

21:48.070 --> 21:50.070
I don't remember any of that myself.

21:50.310 --> 21:51.310
That's not right.

21:51.480 --> 21:52.590
What Yixiao heard was

21:52.590 --> 21:53.510
that she was captured

21:53.510 --> 21:55.200
while trying to save His Highness.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.160
Why is she turning it around

21:56.160 --> 21:58.550
to say His Highness risked his life
to save her?

21:58.550 --> 22:00.080
Is she testing His Highness

22:00.590 --> 22:02.120
or trying to gain his trust?

22:02.750 --> 22:04.170
You're still very weak.

22:04.240 --> 22:06.240
Talking less will help you recover.

22:06.310 --> 22:07.190
Rest well.

22:07.640 --> 22:08.750
I'll stay here

22:08.920 --> 22:10.050
with Xueying for now

22:10.240 --> 22:11.640
until you've recovered.

22:40.640 --> 22:41.200
Sir.

22:41.480 --> 22:42.030
I'm here.

22:48.350 --> 22:50.200
You're an hour late.

22:52.510 --> 22:54.770
There were soldiers on duty near the inn.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.640
On my way here,

22:55.640 --> 22:56.880
I had to be extra careful

22:56.880 --> 22:58.080
not to expose myself,

22:58.270 --> 22:59.550
so it took longer.

23:00.640 --> 23:02.200
The inn where you're staying

23:02.200 --> 23:04.270
is guarded
by the Imperial Guards' Bing Division.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.720
I scheduled our meeting

23:05.880 --> 23:06.790
for the time

23:06.830 --> 23:08.310
when the Bing Division changes shifts.

23:08.310 --> 23:09.160
Shouldn't it be easy

23:09.160 --> 23:10.430
to escape their notice

23:10.590 --> 23:11.440
at that time?

23:12.240 --> 23:13.440
I also had to watch out

23:13.640 --> 23:16.690
for Feng Suige's spies
lurking in the dark.

23:17.110 --> 23:19.310
Feng Suige hasn't placed any men there.

23:19.750 --> 23:20.880
How do you know that?

23:21.110 --> 23:23.110
Nothing that happens in Yujing City

23:23.400 --> 23:24.510
escapes me.

23:25.200 --> 23:26.030
Since your master

23:26.030 --> 23:27.160
arrived in Yujing,

23:27.640 --> 23:29.350
he's met with the Emperor, the Empress,

23:29.350 --> 23:30.610
and even the Princess.

23:30.800 --> 23:33.400
Right now, he's probably
so busy arranging his marriage

23:33.400 --> 23:35.240
that he's forgotten everything

23:35.350 --> 23:36.930
I told you to do.

23:37.030 --> 23:37.830
Rest assured.

23:38.400 --> 23:39.580
We'll never go back

23:39.610 --> 23:40.990
on our word.

23:41.110 --> 23:43.260
Why is Fu Yixiao still alive?

23:47.510 --> 23:49.440
You can't even take down one woman.

23:49.830 --> 23:51.290
If you're so incompetent,

23:51.790 --> 23:53.490
I'll have to do it myself.

23:54.310 --> 23:56.290
And I'll have to reconsider

23:56.440 --> 23:57.200
whether you're still

23:57.200 --> 23:58.640
worth cooperating with.

24:00.510 --> 24:01.500
With Feng Suige around,

24:01.500 --> 24:02.960
killing her isn't so easy.

24:03.330 --> 24:04.990
I need the right opportunity.

24:05.750 --> 24:06.930
Such cowardice.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.660
How can you get anything done?

24:09.000 --> 24:10.070
I know you'll meet

24:10.070 --> 24:11.000
Fu Yixiao again.

24:11.440 --> 24:13.060
That's your chance.

24:13.160 --> 24:14.670
But if I act rashly,

24:15.270 --> 24:17.490
Feng Suige may learn of

24:17.550 --> 24:19.070
His Highness's plans too soon.

24:19.070 --> 24:20.190
Cut the crap!

24:20.480 --> 24:21.940
I want Fu Yixiao dead.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.070
Stop hesitating

24:23.070 --> 24:24.330
and being indecisive.

24:24.350 --> 24:25.920
Just follow my orders.

24:28.740 --> 24:29.830
Sir, don't forget

24:30.640 --> 24:32.590
this is only a partnership.

24:32.610 --> 24:34.210
I don't take orders from you.

24:34.750 --> 24:35.920
Don't you forget

24:36.510 --> 24:38.400
where you are now.

24:38.590 --> 24:39.830
Offend me,

24:39.960 --> 24:41.640
and the consequences will be far worse

24:41.640 --> 24:43.170
than offending Feng Suige.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.130
Please give me more time.

24:47.200 --> 24:49.030
I don't want to hear your excuses.

24:49.030 --> 24:50.740
I only care about the results.

24:51.070 --> 24:52.640
I know every move

24:52.880 --> 24:54.290
each of you makes.

24:55.000 --> 24:55.930
This time,

24:55.960 --> 24:57.490
don't disappoint me again.

25:04.310 --> 25:05.790
[Zhengnian Hall]

25:18.680 --> 25:19.410
Yixiao,

25:20.510 --> 25:21.240
don't worry.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.110
I'll help you remember

25:23.110 --> 25:24.710
everything you want to know.

26:04.070 --> 26:05.340
Don't forget,

26:05.360 --> 26:07.890
you're still my concubine now.

26:08.640 --> 26:10.040
Don't push your luck.

26:10.480 --> 26:12.810
I want Xia Jingshi to see

26:12.920 --> 26:14.330
that his beloved general

26:14.350 --> 26:15.390
is now mine.

26:33.830 --> 26:34.480
Sister.

26:45.630 --> 26:46.360
Sister,

26:46.390 --> 26:47.190
what's wrong?

26:48.810 --> 26:50.420
I remembered something.

26:56.840 --> 26:57.600
Tell me.

26:57.700 --> 26:58.990
What did you remember?

26:59.230 --> 27:01.080
The one who shot me off the cliff

27:02.410 --> 27:03.750
was Xia Jingshi.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.360
What did you say?

27:10.610 --> 27:11.870
Are you sure it was him?

27:12.960 --> 27:13.830
I've wondered

27:13.850 --> 27:15.380
if my memories are confused,

27:15.380 --> 27:16.840
if I was imagining things.

27:17.640 --> 27:18.550
But I went over every conversation

27:18.550 --> 27:19.750
I've had with Xia Jingshi

27:19.750 --> 27:20.790
since we met.

27:21.110 --> 27:22.550
He always seemed

27:22.550 --> 27:23.590
to be subtly testing

27:23.590 --> 27:25.320
what exactly I had remembered.

27:27.270 --> 27:29.070
Have you remembered something?

27:29.360 --> 27:31.260
Ning Fei and Xiao Weiran told me

27:31.480 --> 27:32.270
that the moment

27:32.270 --> 27:33.870
they heard I was still alive,

27:33.910 --> 27:35.290
they rushed to Yujing.

27:35.480 --> 27:37.080
Don't you find that strange?

27:37.750 --> 27:40.080
Isn't it because he was worried about you?

27:40.200 --> 27:42.190
I hope I'm overthinking this,

27:42.640 --> 27:43.680
but I feel

27:43.710 --> 27:45.170
it's more than just worry.

27:45.590 --> 27:46.480
I did think

27:46.510 --> 27:48.110
it was someone close to you.

27:48.200 --> 27:49.350
I suspected Ning Fei.

27:49.350 --> 27:50.640
I suspected Xiao Weiran.

27:50.640 --> 27:51.290
But never have I

27:51.290 --> 27:52.620
suspected Xia Jingshi.

27:53.070 --> 27:54.100
I always thought

27:54.240 --> 27:55.660
he was a good man.

27:55.960 --> 27:56.940
If I hadn't remembered

27:56.940 --> 27:58.440
the moment before I fell off the cliff,

27:58.440 --> 28:00.170
I'd also think he was a good man.

28:00.750 --> 28:02.510
In some of the memories I've recovered,

28:02.510 --> 28:04.160
we fought side by side

28:04.180 --> 28:05.840
and looked out for each other.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.480
He showed me

28:07.480 --> 28:08.590
a lot of kindness.

28:09.200 --> 28:10.750
But why did he do that?

28:11.790 --> 28:12.550
I don't know.

28:13.830 --> 28:14.480
I don't know

28:14.480 --> 28:15.740
why he did that either.

28:16.550 --> 28:17.480
That's why

28:17.480 --> 28:19.480
I need to stay by Xia Jingshi's side.

28:19.710 --> 28:21.420
Ever since I met him,

28:21.510 --> 28:23.190
he's been guarded around me.

28:23.350 --> 28:25.720
Only when he completely
lets his guard down

28:25.720 --> 28:27.440
will I get the truth.

28:36.480 --> 28:37.340
Your Highness.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.510
It's me, Weiran.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.200
Come in.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.020
Your Highness.

28:52.160 --> 28:53.020
I went to the inn

28:53.030 --> 28:54.160
and retrieved this.

28:55.640 --> 28:56.400
Have you forgotten

28:56.400 --> 28:57.440
what I told you?

28:57.880 --> 28:58.680
Of course not.

28:59.550 --> 29:01.010
I just can't bear to see you

29:01.080 --> 29:02.460
suffer from the poison.

29:02.960 --> 29:03.630
You've saved up

29:03.630 --> 29:05.430
these antidotes over the years.

29:05.510 --> 29:06.340
Please,

29:06.440 --> 29:07.500
take one this time.

29:09.300 --> 29:10.900
Before my grand plan begins,

29:11.240 --> 29:13.030
these antidotes must not be touched.

29:13.030 --> 29:13.690
I don't want

29:14.020 --> 29:15.350
to repeat myself again.

29:17.710 --> 29:18.440
Understood.

29:18.830 --> 29:19.560
By the way,

29:20.270 --> 29:21.160
any changes

29:21.250 --> 29:23.240
with the prisoner exchange
to rescue Yixiao?

29:23.240 --> 29:23.830
No.

29:24.350 --> 29:26.410
Susha has agreed to release Yixiao

29:26.510 --> 29:27.970
and let her return with us.

29:31.790 --> 29:32.590
What's wrong?

29:36.200 --> 29:37.060
Your Highness,

29:37.110 --> 29:38.590
don't you think

29:39.160 --> 29:40.890
something's off about Yixiao?

29:41.310 --> 29:42.570
When I met her that day,

29:42.640 --> 29:44.550
she had no interest in catching up.

29:44.550 --> 29:46.640
All she cared about
was recovering her memories.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.960
I don't think she even remembers

29:47.960 --> 29:49.070
the bond we once shared.

29:49.070 --> 29:50.240
She only wanted

29:50.270 --> 29:51.870
to extract the truth from me.

29:52.310 --> 29:54.510
Don't you feel the same, Your Highness?

29:55.550 --> 29:56.070
Were you

29:56.070 --> 29:57.270
eavesdropping on us?

29:58.750 --> 30:00.680
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.460
Put yourself in her shoes.

30:04.580 --> 30:05.720
If I were Yixiao,

30:06.440 --> 30:07.440
seeing my former

30:07.440 --> 30:08.440
friends and comrades now,

30:08.440 --> 30:09.440
I'd also want to ask

30:09.440 --> 30:11.170
what happened to me in the past.

30:11.270 --> 30:13.070
I believe Yixiao knows deep down

30:13.550 --> 30:15.740
that she's still one of us.

30:16.110 --> 30:18.310
Besides, she's now in enemy territory,

30:18.310 --> 30:19.720
constantly on guard against
her mortal enemy,

30:19.720 --> 30:20.400
Feng Suige.

30:20.920 --> 30:21.960
She definitely sees us

30:21.960 --> 30:22.960
as her own people.

30:24.110 --> 30:24.750
But...

30:25.110 --> 30:25.620
Enough.

30:26.590 --> 30:28.050
I've said all I need to say.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.640
I finally got some trust

30:31.640 --> 30:32.790
with Yixiao.

30:33.160 --> 30:34.030
I don't want

30:34.030 --> 30:35.350
this hard-won trust

30:35.440 --> 30:36.170
to be ruined.

30:39.310 --> 30:39.960
Weiran.

30:42.200 --> 30:44.310
Your caution and persistence

30:44.840 --> 30:46.020
are your strengths.

30:46.350 --> 30:48.480
But you don't need to suspect everything.

30:48.480 --> 30:50.430
Even the wisest can make mistakes.

30:50.790 --> 30:51.720
I don't think there is

30:51.720 --> 30:53.250
anything off about Yixiao.

30:54.750 --> 30:56.150
You're overthinking it.

30:57.240 --> 30:58.370
Yes, Your Highness.

30:59.550 --> 31:00.750
I'm just worried

31:01.030 --> 31:02.090
she might remember

31:02.440 --> 31:04.500
the truth about that day on the cliff.

31:04.830 --> 31:05.430
After all…

31:10.440 --> 31:11.300
Your Highness!

31:15.640 --> 31:16.750
I also hope

31:17.750 --> 31:19.610
she never remembers that moment.

31:23.110 --> 31:23.700
Come.

31:28.640 --> 31:30.440
No matter what happened in the past,

31:30.440 --> 31:31.480
I don't want Yixiao

31:31.480 --> 31:33.410
to suffer even the slightest harm.

31:34.160 --> 31:34.890
Understood.

31:36.550 --> 31:37.410
Your Highness,

31:37.440 --> 31:38.400
rest early.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.130
I'll take my leave.

31:58.440 --> 31:59.900
Greetings, Your Majesty.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.160
Rise.

32:08.940 --> 32:11.200
Get rid of someone for me
as soon as possible.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.250
Who is it?

32:12.270 --> 32:14.120
A girl from the Jinxiu Kingdom.

32:14.270 --> 32:15.470
Her name is Fu Yixiao.

32:15.830 --> 32:17.100
The female prisoner

32:17.130 --> 32:18.480
brought back by the First Prince?

32:18.480 --> 32:19.240
What?

32:19.510 --> 32:20.910
Having second thoughts?

32:21.730 --> 32:23.750
You don't dare to harm Feng Suige's woman?

32:23.750 --> 32:24.650
The Xun family

32:24.830 --> 32:26.480
may be only distant relatives
of Your Majesty,

32:26.480 --> 32:27.530
but for years,

32:27.640 --> 32:29.400
we've benefited from your grace.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.570
To serve you

32:31.070 --> 32:32.070
is my honor

32:32.670 --> 32:34.130
and my family's blessing.

32:34.240 --> 32:36.270
You have no choice but to succeed.

32:36.640 --> 32:38.570
And no one shall ever know about it.

32:38.720 --> 32:40.720
Please rest assured, Your Majesty.

32:42.690 --> 32:44.020
Prime Minister Zhuang.

32:44.960 --> 32:45.880
Prime Minister Zhuang.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.920
You're finally here.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.250
Prime Minister Zhuang.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.570
Prime Minister Zhuang.

32:56.920 --> 32:58.110
We're in the heart of the capital.

32:58.110 --> 32:59.460
You're the dignified Minister of Rites.

32:59.460 --> 33:00.960
Stop shouting. Show some decorum.

33:00.960 --> 33:01.640
The First Prince

33:01.640 --> 33:02.350
proposed

33:02.400 --> 33:03.790
a shocking plan.

33:03.810 --> 33:05.160
He said that after the marriage alliance
is formed,

33:05.160 --> 33:07.760
he wants the Prince of Zhennan
to stay in Susha.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.370
Explain.

33:09.480 --> 33:12.180
He wants the Prince of Zhennan
to marry into Susha

33:12.180 --> 33:14.510
and be the Emperor's live-in son-in-law!

33:28.830 --> 33:29.630
Your Majesty.

33:29.720 --> 33:31.660
Shen Wu has already spoken to you?

33:32.550 --> 33:33.030
Yes.

33:37.890 --> 33:39.350
I assume you're aware of the situation.

33:39.350 --> 33:40.260
Then tell me,

33:40.750 --> 33:41.750
what do you think?

33:42.270 --> 33:43.460
In my humble opinion,

33:43.460 --> 33:44.620
forcing the Prince of Zhennan

33:44.620 --> 33:46.190
to stay in Susha

33:46.590 --> 33:47.480
is unwise.

33:49.510 --> 33:52.150
Jinxiu proposed the marriage alliance,

33:52.290 --> 33:53.580
and we agreed.

33:54.310 --> 33:56.090
But neither side ever said

33:56.120 --> 33:57.960
that it had to be
Jinxiu's Prince of Zhennan

33:57.960 --> 33:59.750
who takes our princess away.

34:00.120 --> 34:01.300
That means

34:01.790 --> 34:03.280
we can propose instead

34:03.350 --> 34:04.240
that the Prince of Zhennan

34:04.240 --> 34:06.370
stay in Susha as a live-in son-in-law.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.790
Prime Minister Zhuang,

34:07.790 --> 34:09.199
what's wrong with that?

34:09.320 --> 34:11.030
It's a marriage alliance
between two nations.

34:11.030 --> 34:12.800
Even among the common folk,

34:13.190 --> 34:15.960
it's always the bride
who moves in with the groom.

34:16.480 --> 34:19.139
That's long been the custom.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.530
Who set that custom?

34:20.880 --> 34:21.790
Your Highness,

34:21.810 --> 34:23.440
this concerns two nations.

34:23.489 --> 34:25.280
Please think of the bigger picture.

34:25.280 --> 34:26.989
Marriage is not war.

34:27.230 --> 34:29.449
It isn't about victory or defeat.

34:29.710 --> 34:30.630
Exactly.

34:30.760 --> 34:32.429
It's precisely for the bigger picture

34:32.429 --> 34:34.170
that I want Xia Jingshi to stay in Susha.

34:34.170 --> 34:36.110
This way, we won't break
the marriage alliance

34:36.110 --> 34:37.690
or ruin the peace between the two nations.

34:37.690 --> 34:39.290
We gain nothing but benefit.

34:40.150 --> 34:40.960
We can't do that.

34:40.960 --> 34:42.100
Why not?

34:42.150 --> 34:43.810
The war has only just stopped.

34:44.190 --> 34:46.440
If you kept Xia Jingshi in Susha,

34:46.710 --> 34:49.000
wouldn't that reignite the flames of war?

34:49.000 --> 34:50.480
Without Xia Jingshi, the Zhennan Army

34:50.480 --> 34:51.650
will be leaderless.

34:52.030 --> 34:53.190
I don't believe the Emperor of Jinxiu

34:53.190 --> 34:54.280
would dare declare war on us.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.409
And even if he dares,

34:56.000 --> 34:57.300
why should we be afraid?

34:57.300 --> 35:00.260
Even in war, we don't kill the envoys.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.290
Yet now, under the guise

35:02.550 --> 35:04.190
of a marriage alliance,
you want to detain their prince.

35:04.190 --> 35:06.000
Wouldn't that be going back on our word

35:06.000 --> 35:07.010
and make everyone

35:07.190 --> 35:09.110
despise us?

35:09.110 --> 35:10.840
How is it going back on our word?

35:11.110 --> 35:13.000
When the Emperor of Jinxiu
proposed the alliance,

35:13.000 --> 35:14.070
did he ever say

35:14.120 --> 35:15.880
we couldn't have the Prince of Zhennan

35:15.880 --> 35:17.480
marry into Susha?

35:17.710 --> 35:19.160
But it's against custom.

35:19.760 --> 35:21.310
Which custom exactly?

35:21.440 --> 35:23.070
Does Susha have any law forbidding

35:23.070 --> 35:25.150
a man from being a live-in son-in-law?

35:25.150 --> 35:26.030
Are you objecting

35:26.030 --> 35:27.290
in Susha's interests,

35:27.320 --> 35:28.030
or are you actually

35:28.030 --> 35:29.920
on Jinxiu's side?

35:30.230 --> 35:30.800
You…

35:31.000 --> 35:31.800
Enough!

35:33.190 --> 35:34.320
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

35:34.320 --> 35:35.710
I believe the First Prince

35:35.710 --> 35:37.710
proposed this reckless plan
out of personal resentment.

35:37.710 --> 35:38.880
Because Xia Jingshi

35:39.030 --> 35:40.550
demanded to take away

35:40.630 --> 35:42.230
the female general called Fu Yixiao,

35:42.230 --> 35:43.400
the First Prince is deliberately

35:43.400 --> 35:45.260
making things difficult for him.

35:46.440 --> 35:48.840
Fu Yixiao is your prisoner.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.880
Xia Jingshi wants a prisoner exchange.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.880
What do you think?

35:55.150 --> 35:55.800
Fine.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.510
As long as Your Majesty decrees

35:58.510 --> 36:00.360
that Xia Jingshi be held in Susha,

36:00.360 --> 36:01.480
that woman

36:02.150 --> 36:03.940
can be returned to Jinxiu.

36:04.400 --> 36:05.930
Your Majesty, you must not!

36:10.920 --> 36:13.080
I want Xia Jingshi detained,

36:13.230 --> 36:15.470
yet you keep obstructing me.

36:15.630 --> 36:17.890
Could it be
that keeping Xia Jingshi here

36:18.590 --> 36:21.720
would ruin some scheme of yours,
Prime Minister Zhuang?

36:24.000 --> 36:25.260
What nonsense is that?

36:25.440 --> 36:27.190
As the Prime Minister,

36:27.210 --> 36:28.070
you oppose

36:28.110 --> 36:29.550
a plan that clearly benefits Susha

36:29.550 --> 36:30.880
at every turn.

36:30.910 --> 36:32.970
Instead of focusing on state policy,

36:32.980 --> 36:34.440
you worry whether marrying into Susha

36:34.440 --> 36:35.320
might damage

36:35.340 --> 36:36.790
Xia Jingshi's pride.

36:36.810 --> 36:39.000
You might as well resign
from your position

36:39.000 --> 36:40.030
and go serve

36:40.050 --> 36:42.070
as Xia Jingshi's strategist instead.

36:42.070 --> 36:44.320
Your Highness targets me at every turn.

36:44.360 --> 36:46.000
Is it because of that matter

36:46.000 --> 36:46.970
from years ago?

36:47.000 --> 36:48.150
I have said before—

36:49.630 --> 36:50.960
what happened back then

36:52.590 --> 36:53.280
is not

36:53.920 --> 36:55.230
to be mentioned again.

36:56.030 --> 36:56.830
Your Majesty,

36:56.880 --> 36:59.380
I spoke out of turn
in the heat of the moment.

36:59.480 --> 37:00.920
Please forgive me.

37:07.480 --> 37:09.040
This is a serious matter

37:09.230 --> 37:10.550
that requires careful consideration.

37:10.550 --> 37:13.400
We need to discuss it
with the Emperor of Jinxiu.

37:16.230 --> 37:17.030
Your Majesty,

37:17.150 --> 37:17.920
I've already sent a letter

37:17.920 --> 37:19.430
to the Emperor of Jinxiu,

37:19.550 --> 37:20.570
formally raising the matter

37:20.570 --> 37:22.320
of Xia Jingshi marrying into Susha.

37:22.320 --> 37:23.430
Soon enough,

37:23.480 --> 37:24.280
we will have

37:24.320 --> 37:25.730
his reply.

37:26.960 --> 37:27.480
Your Majesty…

37:27.480 --> 37:28.810
Prime Minister Zhuang,

37:29.110 --> 37:30.360
you may leave.

37:32.230 --> 37:33.440
Yes, Your Majesty.

37:54.250 --> 37:58.110
[Yujing City]

37:55.980 --> 37:57.960
The wedding procession
of the Prince of Zhennan from Jinxiu

37:57.960 --> 37:59.560
is about to arrive in Yujing!

38:00.450 --> 38:02.710
[Peace]

38:01.280 --> 38:03.320
The wedding procession
of the Prince of Zhennan from Jinxiu

38:03.320 --> 38:04.920
is about to arrive in Yujing!

38:06.070 --> 38:08.360
When did you write to Xia Jingyan?

38:08.440 --> 38:09.680
Three days ago.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.130
By calculation,

38:11.280 --> 38:13.000
he should have read

38:13.000 --> 38:14.260
the letter last night.

38:18.510 --> 38:20.310
Here is the exact message I sent,

38:20.840 --> 38:21.850
word for word.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.840
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.480
Read it.

38:28.210 --> 38:30.150
"The Prince of Zhennan is
both wise and brave,

38:30.150 --> 38:31.440
a talent sent by Heaven.

38:31.440 --> 38:32.510
In him, I see brilliance

38:32.510 --> 38:33.800
beyond compare—

38:34.150 --> 38:36.080
even Song Yu cannot surpass him,

38:36.230 --> 38:38.210
nor can Zhou Gongjin rival him.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.640
My father once said

38:39.800 --> 38:41.260
gaining such a son-in-law

38:41.320 --> 38:43.400
is better than gaining 100,000 scholars.

38:43.400 --> 38:44.750
He cherishes him

38:44.920 --> 38:46.380
as his own flesh and blood.

38:46.760 --> 38:48.000
As for my sister Xiyang,

38:48.000 --> 38:49.000
apple of Father's eye,

38:49.000 --> 38:51.290
she once attended Father on his sickbed.

38:51.440 --> 38:53.800
Her filial piety and virtue
are rare in this age.

38:53.800 --> 38:55.550
Father cannot bear
to marry her off to a distant land,

38:55.550 --> 38:58.030
and he treasures the brilliance
of the Prince of Zhennan too.

38:58.030 --> 38:59.350
In Yujing,

38:59.440 --> 39:02.150
we'll present grand estates
and fertile lands as gifts,

39:02.150 --> 39:04.070
hoping the Prince of Zhennan
may remain in Susha—

39:04.070 --> 39:05.000
father and daughter together,

39:05.000 --> 39:07.330
brothers close, husband and wife united.

39:07.510 --> 39:10.440
Your wish to strengthen bonds
between our two nations can be fulfilled.

39:10.440 --> 39:11.440
Everyone in Susha

39:11.440 --> 39:13.240
admires the Prince of Zhennan.

39:13.550 --> 39:15.750
We earnestly request you
to consider it

39:15.800 --> 39:17.730
and graciously give your assent."

39:18.280 --> 39:18.840
Not easy.

39:20.190 --> 39:21.320
Not easy at all.

39:21.960 --> 39:24.400
Writing such high praise
for the Prince of Zhennan—

39:24.400 --> 39:26.890
you really know how to bend when needed.

39:27.150 --> 39:28.670
Among all the civil officials in my court,

39:28.670 --> 39:29.510
I can hardly

39:29.510 --> 39:30.840
find anyone who can flatter

39:30.840 --> 39:32.440
Xia Jingshi better than you.

39:33.550 --> 39:34.820
Thank you for your praise.

39:34.820 --> 39:36.390
How dare you!

39:36.510 --> 39:37.400
Your Majesty, you should wait

39:37.400 --> 39:39.860
until the Emperor
of Jinxiu's reply arrives

39:39.960 --> 39:41.360
and then see whether my move

39:41.360 --> 39:42.750
was bold

39:42.880 --> 39:44.320
and reckless.

39:45.480 --> 39:47.380
You sure can keep your cool.

39:47.920 --> 39:48.660
It seems

39:48.840 --> 39:50.630
you already know how Xia Jingyan

39:50.630 --> 39:51.760
will handle this.

39:53.760 --> 39:55.180
He will agree.

39:55.320 --> 39:56.480
Actually, Xia Jingyan

39:56.480 --> 39:58.110
may even fan the flames

39:58.610 --> 40:01.460
to push Xia Jingshi
into marrying into Susha.

40:03.880 --> 40:05.510
After all, whether for us

40:05.550 --> 40:07.350
or for the Emperor of Jinxiu,

40:07.760 --> 40:09.190
keeping the Prince of Zhennan,

40:09.190 --> 40:10.630
who's backed by an army, in Susha

40:10.630 --> 40:12.680
brings only benefits and no harm.

40:12.920 --> 40:13.760
I bet Xia Jingyan

40:13.760 --> 40:15.090
would have been pleased

40:15.440 --> 40:16.840
when he read this letter.

40:17.800 --> 40:19.230
The letter has been sent,

40:20.150 --> 40:22.550
so there's no taking it back.

40:23.000 --> 40:23.710
Xia Jingshi

40:24.590 --> 40:26.030
wouldn't like

40:26.030 --> 40:27.710
what the letter will bring forth,

40:27.710 --> 40:29.140
but Susha

40:29.280 --> 40:30.840
will benefit a lot from it.

40:30.860 --> 40:32.470
Yet still, you acted on your own,

40:32.470 --> 40:34.480
interfering with the major affairs
between the two nations.

40:34.480 --> 40:36.010
Your Majesty once taught me

40:36.320 --> 40:38.440
that the wise weigh gains and losses.

40:38.510 --> 40:40.190
That letter was written

40:40.190 --> 40:41.400
after I thought it through carefully

40:41.400 --> 40:42.630
and analyzed the pros and cons.

40:42.630 --> 40:43.630
Enough.

40:44.230 --> 40:46.070
Don't fob me off

40:46.070 --> 40:47.230
with those high-sounding words.

40:47.230 --> 40:48.960
I'm not Prime Minister Zhuang.

40:49.280 --> 40:51.680
I don't have the patience
to argue with you.

40:52.400 --> 40:54.000
I did act on my own.

40:54.630 --> 40:55.490
For the nation,

40:55.630 --> 40:57.630
I want to understand
why Jinxiu is so eager

40:57.630 --> 40:59.800
to form a marriage alliance with Susha.

40:59.800 --> 41:00.460
For myself,

41:00.590 --> 41:01.900
I want to see

41:02.000 --> 41:03.230
how Xia Jingshi will treat Xiyang

41:03.230 --> 41:05.350
after marrying her.

41:05.440 --> 41:06.150
I don't expect

41:06.150 --> 41:07.470
to keep him long.

41:07.920 --> 41:09.150
A year or two is enough

41:09.150 --> 41:10.800
to see everything clearly.

41:14.820 --> 41:16.320
If this letter

41:16.430 --> 41:17.360
damages

41:17.400 --> 41:19.030
the peace between our two nations,

41:19.030 --> 41:20.800
I will accept the blame.

41:25.800 --> 41:26.400
All right.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.630
You may leave.

41:46.960 --> 41:48.630
Your Majesty, you look so pleased.

41:48.630 --> 41:50.290
Has something good happened?

41:50.900 --> 41:53.180
He didn't disappoint me.

41:53.480 --> 41:54.710
Your Majesty, you mean

41:54.710 --> 41:55.920
the First Prince?

42:03.310 --> 42:04.430
[Emperor, the Prince of Zhennan is both
wise and brave, a talent sent by Heaven.]

42:04.450 --> 42:05.650
[In him, I see brilliance beyond compare—
even Song Yu cannot surpass him,]

42:05.670 --> 42:06.390
[nor can Zhou Gongjin rival him.
My father once said]

42:06.390 --> 42:07.110
[gaining such a son-in-law
is better than gaining 100,000 scholars.]

42:07.130 --> 42:08.030
[He cherishes him
as his own flesh and blood.]

42:08.110 --> 42:08.240
[Shengfu Hall]

42:08.240 --> 42:15.990
[Shengfu Hall,
the Imperial Palace of Jinxiu]

42:24.930 --> 42:27.100
[Shengfu Hall]

42:26.280 --> 42:27.940
Greetings, Empress Dowager.

42:31.860 --> 42:33.160
[Empress Dowager Jing of Jinxiu]

42:37.770 --> 42:38.300
You…

42:40.960 --> 42:42.480
Clear everyone out.

42:45.070 --> 42:45.840
All of them?

42:46.380 --> 42:47.910
Such disgraceful behavior

42:47.920 --> 42:49.680
must never be known outside these walls.

42:49.510 --> 42:55.740
[Shengfu Hall]

42:50.320 --> 42:50.960
Yes.

43:01.870 --> 43:02.980
Empress Dowager, please wait.

43:02.980 --> 43:04.960
His Majesty is occupied at the moment.

43:04.960 --> 43:06.760
His Majesty is in rare good spirits today.

43:06.760 --> 43:07.540
Leave.

43:47.440 --> 43:48.000
Hurry!

43:54.920 --> 43:55.920
Your Majesty!

43:58.380 --> 44:02.840
[Xia Jingyan, Emperor of Jinxiu]
